@startuml 11-despliegue-tobe
title Spring PetClinic — Despliegue to-be (F-03 + F-05, Fases 5-6) [Iteración 1]
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Usuario" as USER
actor "Cliente REST" as APICLIENT

node "Cliente" as CLIENT <<device>> {
	artifact "Navegador" as BROWSER
}

node "Runtime local / EC2 (t3.medium)" as HOST <<execution environment>> {
	artifact "Docker Engine" as DOCKER
	node "Contenedor petclinic\n(Dockerfile multi-stage, JRE 21 slim)" as CONTAINER <<Docker>> {
		artifact "spring-petclinic.jar\nSpring Boot 4.0.3 · **Java 21**" as JAR #E8F5E9
		artifact "MVC + Thymeleaf\n(legado, sin cambios)" as MVC #FFF8E1
		artifact "**REST API /api/owners**\n(OwnerRestController)" as REST #E8F4FD
		artifact "**Capa @Service**\n(PetService, VisitService, OwnerService)" as SVC #E8F4FD
		artifact "Actuator\n/actuator/health" as ACT
	}
}

node "Amazon EC2\n(instancias gemelas legado/modernizado)" as EC2 <<execution environment>> {
	artifact "IAM role\n(pull ECR + logs/métricas CloudWatch)" as IAM
}

node "Amazon ECR" as ECR <<execution environment>> {
	artifact "Imagen spring-petclinic\n(escaneo + lifecycle 10 imágenes)" as ECRIMG
}

database "Amazon RDS PostgreSQL 18.x\n(subred privada, storage_encrypted)" as RDS #E8F5E9
database "H2 embebida\n(perfil default, legado)" as H2 #FFF8E1
database "MySQL 9.6 / PostgreSQL 18.3\n(docker-compose.yml, legado)" as LOCALDB #FFF8E1

cloud "Amazon CloudWatch" as CW {
	artifact "Log group\nretención 7 días" as LOGS
	artifact "Alarmas CPU / memoria" as ALARMS
}

USER --> BROWSER
APICLIENT --> JAR : HTTPS :8080\n/api/owners (JSON)
BROWSER --> JAR : HTTP :8080\nThymeleaf (HTML)
JAR --> MVC
JAR --> REST
JAR --> SVC
MVC --> SVC : delega en\n(F-03)
REST --> SVC : delega en\n(F-05)
JAR --> ACT
JAR --> RDS : JDBC\nperfil postgres (AWS)
JAR ..> H2 : JDBC\nperfil default (dev local)
JAR ..> LOCALDB : JDBC\nperfil mysql/postgres (dev local)
DOCKER --> CONTAINER
EC2 --> DOCKER
ECR --> EC2 : docker pull\n(user_data)
IAM .up.> ECR
JAR --> LOGS : logs
EC2 --> ALARMS : métricas

note bottom of CONTAINER
  **Legado conservado (gris/amarillo):** entidades JPA, repositorios,
  templates Thymeleaf, MVC controllers — sin cambios de comportamiento.
  **Nuevo (azul):** capa @Service (F-03) y API REST /api/owners (F-05),
  ambos añadidos sin tocar el camino MVC existente (patrón Wrapping).
end note

note bottom of RDS
  Mismo motor/major version que docker-compose.yml del legado
  (PostgreSQL) para que el experimento sea comparable.
  Acceso solo desde el security group de la app (Fase 6).
end note

note right of HOST
  Reemplaza el nodo "Runtime local / servidor" del as-is
  (02-despliegue.puml): antes ejecutaba el JAR directo con
  Java 17; ahora corre en contenedor Docker (Fase 5) con
  Java 21 (Fase 1), desplegado sobre EC2 (Fase 6).
end note

@enduml
